# Quantum Fourier Transform  (3-qubit)
# Maps computational basis states to the frequency domain.
# Angles in half-turns: 0.5 = pi/2 phase (S-gate), 0.25 = pi/4 phase (T-gate).

# Stage q0: H then controlled-phase from q1 and q2
q 0 -> H | CU1(0.5, q 1) | CU1(0.25, q 2)  # control from q1 and q2, target q0

# Stage q1: H then controlled-phase from q2
q 1 -> H | CU1(0.5, q 2)  # control from q2, target q1

# Stage q2: H only (no more control qubits)
q 2 -> H

# Bit-reversal permutation
q 0 -> SWAP(q 2)
